WEBVTT

00:09.730 --> 00:10.860
<b>Brother!</b>

00:10.860 --> 00:12.400
<b>Welcome home!</b>

00:14.150 --> 00:15.320
<b>I'm home.</b>

00:16.950 --> 00:18.740
<b>Sorry you had to stay home this time.</b>

00:19.080 --> 00:20.330
<b>Oh no.</b>

00:20.330 --> 00:23.500
<b>Just seeing you safe and sound...</b>

00:23.910 --> 00:25.830
<b>is enough for me!</b>

00:32.090 --> 00:33.010
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:33.630 --> 00:36.300
<b>The job our aunt requested
is proceeding well.</b>

00:36.640 --> 00:41.930
<b>I could even say I've pretty much fulfilled
my part of the job.</b>

00:41.930 --> 00:42.640
<b>No.</b>

00:42.930 --> 00:46.150
<b>That's for you to handle, Brother.</b>

00:49.020 --> 00:51.900
<b>Well then, what are you
wondering about? You can ask me.</b>

00:53.940 --> 00:55.570
<b>Brother...</b>

00:55.570 --> 00:58.530
<b>What was the cause of Minoru's condition?</b>

01:02.200 --> 01:04.410
<b>Minoru's magical power is so strong...</b>

01:04.750 --> 01:07.000
<b>that his body can't withstand it.</b>

01:07.000 --> 01:09.380
<b>That's just the state he's in now, right?</b>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.800
<b>Brother, you saw the cause
of his conditions, didn't you?</b>

01:14.130 --> 01:15.760
<b>Why would you ask me that?</b>

01:16.380 --> 01:18.800
<b>The way you acted that day...</b>

01:18.800 --> 01:20.510
<b>wasn't normal.</b>

01:20.800 --> 01:24.140
<b>What exactly is causing you concern?</b>

01:25.020 --> 01:27.390
<b>Brother, please!</b>

01:27.730 --> 01:32.020
<b>I want you to tell me
what's troubling you so!</b>

01:32.440 --> 01:36.110
<b>Please share your anxieties with me!</b>

01:37.570 --> 01:39.700
<b>It's better that you don't know.</b>

01:40.070 --> 01:41.030
<b>Please!</b>

01:41.370 --> 01:43.910
<b>Please don't suffer all by yourself!</b>

01:48.580 --> 01:50.080
<b>Fine.</b>

01:50.080 --> 01:54.300
<b>It's a pretty shocking story, so I want you
to stay strong while you're listening to me.</b>

01:55.670 --> 01:56.800
<b>All right.</b>

01:58.630 --> 02:00.760
<b>Minoru and Ms. Fujibayashi...</b>

02:00.760 --> 02:02.010
<b>are half siblings.</b>

02:03.060 --> 02:07.230
<b>MAKOTO'S YOUNGER SISTER</b>

02:03.390 --> 02:07.230
<b>MAKOTO</b>

02:03.640 --> 02:07.230
<b>KYOKO</b>

02:03.890 --> 02:07.230
<b>MINORU</b>

02:07.230 --> 02:08.640
<b>That can't be!</b>

02:09.060 --> 02:13.520
<b>After all, Ms. Fujibayashi's mother
is Minoru's father's...</b>

02:13.820 --> 02:15.480
<b>biological sister.</b>

02:16.190 --> 02:18.530
<b>Minoru's a genetically modified being.</b>

02:19.030 --> 02:21.320
<b>He was probably born
from artificial insemination.</b>

02:21.950 --> 02:24.490
<b>So, strictly speaking,
they didn't conduct incest...</b>

02:24.910 --> 02:29.290
<b>but that doesn't change the fact
that he's the child of biological siblings.</b>

02:30.120 --> 02:31.170
<b>Then...</b>

02:31.170 --> 02:35.630
<b>Minoru's condition is an ill effect of incest?</b>

02:37.420 --> 02:42.140
<b>I can't say for sure. The problem
is the imbalance in his Psion body...</b>

02:42.140 --> 02:44.510
<b>and physically, he's healthy.</b>

02:44.510 --> 02:47.640
<b>There might've been a problem
during the modification process.</b>

02:49.770 --> 02:50.440
<b>But...</b>

02:50.810 --> 02:54.610
<b>we also can't rule out the possibility that it was due
to his parents' genes being too similar to each other.</b>

02:55.020 --> 03:00.950
<b>We still know so little about how genes
can affect the Psion body...</b>

03:00.950 --> 03:03.120
<b>and the psyche.</b>

03:03.820 --> 03:05.530
<b>But, no...</b>

04:38.630 --> 04:43.010
<b>OCTOBER 27, A.D. 2096
THE DAY BEFORE
THE THESIS COMPETITION</b>

04:44.130 --> 04:45.510
<b>We're here!</b>

04:59.520 --> 05:00.480
<b>Mr. Tatsuya...</b>

05:00.820 --> 05:03.820
<b>We were able to prepare
all of the things you requested.</b>

05:03.820 --> 05:09.160
<b>We got the same motorcycle model
that you use, Big Bro Tatsuya.</b>

05:10.160 --> 05:14.870
<b>As for your attire, we have a set of stabproof
and bulletproof clothing ready for you.</b>

05:15.210 --> 05:17.170
<b>Would you like to change into them now?</b>

05:17.170 --> 05:19.500
<b>Thanks. I'll be using them.</b>

05:21.710 --> 05:24.630
<b>Well then, let us show you to your room.</b>

05:26.430 --> 05:27.380
<b>So?</b>

05:27.720 --> 05:30.510
<b>The thing is, it's hard to believe.</b>

05:30.510 --> 05:33.810
<b>The JGDF Uji 2nd Supply Base...</b>

05:33.810 --> 05:37.440
<b>There's virtually no doubt
that he's being sheltered there.</b>

05:37.770 --> 05:41.230
<b>I see. No wonder he's been so hard to find.</b>

05:44.240 --> 05:45.110
<b>Fumiya...</b>

05:45.110 --> 05:45.820
<b>Yes?</b>

05:46.110 --> 05:47.910
<b>Can I make an outside call?</b>

05:48.530 --> 05:50.660
<b>Hold on for a second, please.</b>

05:53.540 --> 05:56.160
<b><i>Huh, Tatsuya?
What's with the sudden call?</i></b>

05:56.460 --> 05:59.920
<b>Lieutenant, I'm in Kyoto right now.</b>

06:00.460 --> 06:01.460
<b><i>Is that right?</i></b>

06:01.460 --> 06:02.920
<b>Have you found him?</b>

06:04.760 --> 06:08.430
<b><i>We do have an idea
where Gongjin Zhou might be hiding.</i></b>

06:08.430 --> 06:09.430
<b>Where would that be?</b>

06:10.760 --> 06:13.850
<b><i>The military police will be mobilizing.</i></b>

06:13.850 --> 06:16.980
<b>Special Officer Oguro,
I ask you not to intervene.</b>

06:16.980 --> 06:20.600
<b><i>That doesn't apply
to the special mission rules.</i></b>

06:20.900 --> 06:21.980
<b>Ms. Fujibayashi...</b>

06:22.400 --> 06:24.610
<b>Where is Gongjin Zhou?</b>

06:24.610 --> 06:28.860
<b>As a relative of the Kudous, with whom I've received
a promise of cooperation, please answer me.</b>

06:30.280 --> 06:34.120
<b><i>He's inside the JGDF Uji 2nd Supply Base.</i></b>

06:34.870 --> 06:38.250
<b><i>Tatsuya, just let the JDF handle this!</i></b>

06:38.500 --> 06:43.340
<b><i>If you're found to have trespassed onto the base,
even you won't get off lightly!</i></b>

06:43.630 --> 06:45.420
<b>Understood. Goodbye.</b>

06:45.420 --> 06:46.590
<b><i>Tatsuya—</i></b>

06:46.920 --> 06:48.470
<b>There's our confirmation.</b>

06:48.470 --> 06:49.720
<b>What's the plan?</b>

06:49.720 --> 06:53.930
<b>We'll mobilize as the sun sets,
and infiltrate the base.</b>

06:54.220 --> 06:55.430
<b>And your infiltration route?</b>

06:55.430 --> 06:59.270
<b>We'll enter openly from multiple gates.</b>

06:59.270 --> 07:02.060
<b>Of course, in case he makes a run for it...</b>

07:02.440 --> 07:05.190
<b>we'll have people positioned
outside the gates, too.</b>

07:06.230 --> 07:08.440
<b>I'm not sure if that'll be enough people.</b>

07:11.490 --> 07:13.030
<b>Fumiya, Ayako...</b>

07:13.030 --> 07:15.450
<b>I'm going to arrange
for some reinforcements.</b>

07:15.870 --> 07:18.450
<b>There might not be enough time
for us to meet up on-site...</b>

07:18.830 --> 07:21.250
<b>but when the time comes,
I'll be going in, as well.</b>

07:21.250 --> 07:22.460
<b>Understood.</b>

07:22.460 --> 07:24.920
<b>Please be careful, Mr. Tatsuya.</b>

07:24.920 --> 07:27.460
<b>You, too, Fumiya and Ayako.
Don't let your guard down.</b>

07:27.800 --> 07:29.970
<b>- All right!
- Of course!</b>

07:34.510 --> 07:35.970
<b>Brother...</b>

07:37.060 --> 07:39.020
<b>Please be safe.</b>

07:46.690 --> 07:49.570
<b><i>Is that you, Shiba? What do you want?</i></b>

07:49.570 --> 07:53.160
<b>Ichijo, I've narrowed down
where Gongjin Zhou is hiding.</b>

07:53.160 --> 07:54.160
<b><i>For real?</i></b>

07:54.450 --> 07:58.540
<b>I'll be waiting by the southwest entrance
of the Uji Futagozuka Park.</b>

07:56.370 --> 07:58.540
<b>SUPPLY BASE</b>

07:58.540 --> 07:59.910
<b>Gotcha!</b>

07:59.910 --> 08:01.290
<b>I'll be right there!</b>

08:03.040 --> 08:05.670
<b>JGDF UJI 2nd SUPPLY BASE</b>

08:08.300 --> 08:11.590
<b>Dr. Zhou, are you leaving already?</b>

08:11.590 --> 08:15.800
<b>Captain Hatae, it pains me
to say goodbye, as well...</b>

08:15.800 --> 08:19.270
<b>but it seems I've been sniffed out.</b>

08:19.600 --> 08:21.770
<b>Is that right? How unfortunate.</b>

08:22.230 --> 08:27.270
<b>So long as you're on this base,
I wouldn't let them lay a finger on you.</b>

08:27.770 --> 08:31.990
<b>It can't be helped. After all, they have
His Excellency, Kudou, on their side.</b>

08:33.320 --> 08:37.620
<b>I was hoping to learn more
about immortality from you.</b>

08:38.030 --> 08:40.490
<b>So, when will you be departing?</b>

08:40.740 --> 08:43.620
<b>I'm thinking of leaving during the night.</b>

08:44.210 --> 08:47.250
<b>Then, at least, let me provide you with a car.</b>

08:47.790 --> 08:52.170
<b>I am truly grateful
for all that you've done for me.</b>

09:01.850 --> 09:03.060
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

09:04.100 --> 09:06.810
<b>So, where's Gongjin Zhou?</b>

09:07.610 --> 09:09.190
<b>Over there.</b>

09:10.860 --> 09:13.190
<b>With the JDF?! No way!</b>

09:13.570 --> 09:16.360
<b>The JGDF Uji 2nd Supply Base.</b>

09:16.660 --> 09:19.450
<b>That's where Gongjin Zhou
has been lying low.</b>

09:19.870 --> 09:22.910
<b>I'm going to break in by scaling the fence.</b>

09:23.330 --> 09:25.040
<b>Ichijo, what are you going to do?</b>

09:28.420 --> 09:31.300
<b><i>If they find out we trespassed
onto the base, there'll be hell to pay.</i></b>

09:31.590 --> 09:33.010
<b><i>And not just for me.</i></b>

09:33.010 --> 09:37.800
<b><i>At the very least, our school will be forced
to withdraw from the Thesis Competition.</i></b>

09:38.510 --> 09:39.510
<b><i>Even so...</i></b>

09:39.510 --> 09:41.760
<b><i>I'm a member of the Ten Master Clans!</i></b>

09:41.760 --> 09:42.810
<b>I'll be going, too!</b>

09:43.140 --> 09:48.600
<b>If I hadn't been deceived by that man last year,
this would've been resolved by now.</b>

09:48.600 --> 09:50.310
<b>I can't look the other way!</b>

09:54.110 --> 09:55.440
<b>Let's go, Ichijo!</b>

09:55.440 --> 09:56.320
<b>Roger that!</b>

10:05.540 --> 10:06.620
<b>Thank you.</b>

10:06.620 --> 10:08.250
<b>I'll summon you when I'm done...</b>

10:08.540 --> 10:11.000
<b>so could you find a place to wait for me?</b>

10:11.000 --> 10:14.000
<b>Master Minoru, will you be waiting here?</b>

10:14.000 --> 10:14.760
<b>That's right.</b>

10:15.170 --> 10:20.260
<b>If Gongjin Zhou manages to escape,
he'll be heading this way for sure.</b>

10:20.260 --> 10:23.680
<b>And when he comes,
I'll have to stop him in his tracks.</b>

10:23.680 --> 10:25.020
<b>B-But...</b>

10:25.020 --> 10:29.190
<b>even if he decides to cross the Uji River,
there's also a bridge over Ootori.</b>

10:29.190 --> 10:31.520
<b>That one's an overpass, right?</b>

10:31.810 --> 10:36.650
<b>The moment he's on that overpass,
his choices for escape routes will be limited.</b>

10:36.940 --> 10:39.660
<b>But there's also a chance
that he'll flee eastward.</b>

10:39.660 --> 10:40.660
<b>It'll be fine.</b>

10:41.820 --> 10:44.450
<b>My deduction is not wrong.</b>

10:47.500 --> 10:49.040
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
ANCIENT CITY INSURRECTION PART V</b>

10:54.500 --> 10:55.800
<b>It's time.</b>

10:56.210 --> 10:57.300
<b>Commence the operation!</b>

10:57.590 --> 10:58.630
<b>Right!</b>

11:02.760 --> 11:04.260
<b>Well, it's started.</b>

11:04.260 --> 11:06.140
<b>Is that Big Bro Tatsuya?</b>

11:06.140 --> 11:09.060
<b>Yes. He must be acting as our decoy.</b>

11:09.600 --> 11:14.320
<b>I think he must be planning to drive off
our prey from the north side to the south.</b>

11:14.860 --> 11:18.440
<b>Why would Big Bro Tatsuya
do something so dangerous?</b>

11:18.440 --> 11:21.200
<b>Mr. Tatsuya has confidence.</b>

11:21.200 --> 11:26.370
<b>That no matter how grave the danger
he finds himself in, he can overcome it.</b>

11:26.370 --> 11:30.000
<b>That's why he willingly takes on
the most dangerous tasks, I'm sure.</b>

11:31.080 --> 11:32.290
<b>You're right.</b>

11:32.290 --> 11:36.250
<b>We can't let Mr. Tatsuya's
thoughtfulness go to waste.</b>

11:36.250 --> 11:38.760
<b>That would be inexcusable.</b>

11:38.760 --> 11:41.680
<b>We must track Gongjin Zhou
down without fail.</b>

11:41.680 --> 11:43.390
<b>I know that.</b>

11:43.720 --> 11:46.390
<b>- What's going on?
- Hurry the hell up!</b>

11:46.850 --> 11:48.350
<b>Apprehend them!</b>

11:48.810 --> 11:49.640
<b>Hurry!</b>

11:49.930 --> 11:50.850
<b>What's going on?</b>

11:50.850 --> 11:53.440
<b>Someone's trespassed onto the base!
There are two of them!</b>

11:53.440 --> 11:55.520
<b>They're both thought to be magicians!</b>

11:55.520 --> 11:57.480
<b>What? What's the status?</b>

11:57.480 --> 12:00.530
<b>They're making their way over here
while destroying the supplies!</b>

12:00.530 --> 12:02.400
<b>We've been firing at them,
but they won't stop!</b>

12:06.200 --> 12:07.950
<b>This is the perfect opportunity.</b>

12:08.370 --> 12:11.410
<b>I'd like you all to please eliminate
those trespassers.</b>

12:11.410 --> 12:14.290
<b>Using all of the forces on the base.</b>

12:19.630 --> 12:24.130
<b>Captain, I'm going to take you up
on your offer and borrow your car.</b>

12:24.130 --> 12:25.430
<b>The keys, please.</b>

12:26.800 --> 12:29.310
<b>Now then, what are you doing?</b>

12:29.310 --> 12:31.640
<b>You must remove those intruders.</b>

12:31.640 --> 12:34.560
<b>Unless you eliminate
all traces of such rogues...</b>

12:34.560 --> 12:39.190
<b>who would break into the base
until there's nothing left of their corpses...</b>

12:39.480 --> 12:42.320
<b>you can't uphold
the prestige of the military.</b>

12:42.320 --> 12:47.200
<b>Right. The JDF is being challenged here.</b>

12:47.530 --> 12:51.330
<b>Don't let them underestimate you.
Make sure you annihilate them.</b>

12:51.330 --> 12:52.450
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

13:01.260 --> 13:03.010
<b>What kind of magic is that?!</b>

13:03.010 --> 13:04.720
<b>This is no time to be asking that!</b>

13:06.340 --> 13:09.100
<b>Anyway, you're not disposing
of the fuel fast enough!</b>

13:09.100 --> 13:11.060
<b>This kind of thing takes time, all right?</b>

13:14.810 --> 13:17.810
<b><i>I'm vaporizing the hydrogen-absorbing
liquid in the fuel...</i></b>

13:17.810 --> 13:20.520
<b><i>and using Convergence-Type Magic
to separate the hydrogen gases...</i></b>

13:20.900 --> 13:25.820
<b><i>turning them into spheres
and releasing them into the atmosphere...</i></b>

13:25.820 --> 13:27.740
<b><i>where there's no chance of it igniting!</i></b>

13:31.990 --> 13:34.410
<b>Blowing things up
isn't the only thing you can do, is it?</b>

13:34.410 --> 13:35.710
<b>I know!</b>

13:40.090 --> 13:41.170
<b>They're firing on us!</b>

13:41.800 --> 13:42.800
<b>Live bullets, huh?</b>

13:43.130 --> 13:45.800
<b>Looks like they're being manipulated, as well.</b>

13:47.640 --> 13:49.260
<b><i>Is that what's going on?</i></b>

13:55.730 --> 13:58.020
<b>Hey, now they're rolling out tanks!</b>

13:58.400 --> 14:01.690
<b>Are you kidding me?
Are they planning to start a civil war?</b>

14:03.280 --> 14:05.990
<b>We're going to go straight through!
Don't blow them up.</b>

14:05.990 --> 14:06.900
<b>Are you crazy?</b>

14:08.410 --> 14:09.990
<b>What the hell? Leave it to me!</b>

14:20.880 --> 14:21.960
<b>Great job.</b>

14:21.960 --> 14:24.300
<b>Your praise doesn't make me happy!</b>

14:26.300 --> 14:27.420
<b>That's him!</b>

14:27.420 --> 14:28.930
<b>What?</b>

14:31.350 --> 14:32.430
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

14:32.430 --> 14:33.930
<b><i>What's this?</i></b>

14:34.310 --> 14:36.020
<b>The single needle of a bee, huh?</b>

14:36.520 --> 14:39.440
<b>I won't let your death be in vain.</b>

14:42.730 --> 14:46.570
<b>Gongjin Zhou is approaching
the South Gate here.</b>

14:46.860 --> 14:48.570
<b>- Go after him!
- Yes, sir!</b>

14:48.570 --> 14:50.160
<b>No, I mean, "ma'am"!</b>

14:50.160 --> 14:52.370
<b>It doesn't matter! Hurry up and drive!</b>

15:01.130 --> 15:04.000
<b>I'm getting some bad vibes.</b>

15:04.500 --> 15:07.760
<b>Well, but I'm used to being pursued.</b>

15:10.930 --> 15:12.300
<b>Minoru Kudou!</b>

15:12.300 --> 15:13.640
<b>Why is he here?</b>

15:23.520 --> 15:24.980
<b>What's going on?</b>

15:33.410 --> 15:34.660
<b><i>That boy...</i></b>

15:34.660 --> 15:39.580
<b><i>He may have hit bystanders and other cars,
but he didn't even hesitate to blow up my car!</i></b>

15:42.290 --> 15:43.080
<b><i>Chi!</i></b>

15:47.130 --> 15:48.340
<b>Is that Parade?</b>

15:51.180 --> 15:52.220
<b>Huh?</b>

15:52.800 --> 15:55.470
<b><i>I'm misdirecting his aim with Ghost Walker,</i></b>

15:55.470 --> 15:58.970
<b><i>but Minoru Kudou's magic
is gradually homing in on me!</i></b>

16:08.400 --> 16:09.360
<b><i>Mr. Tatsuya...</i></b>

16:09.610 --> 16:11.400
<b><i>I'm leaving the rest to you.</i></b>

16:20.700 --> 16:21.830
<b>Mock Teleportation?</b>

16:32.050 --> 16:34.010
<b>Masaki Ichijo...</b>

16:34.300 --> 16:39.970
<b>It's been a long time, Gongjin Zhou.
You really made a mockery of me that day.</b>

16:42.310 --> 16:46.230
<b>Jumping into water
before the Ichijo Family's Rupture...</b>

16:46.230 --> 16:49.020
<b>is the same as charging
into a pile of explosives.</b>

16:49.650 --> 16:51.860
<b>Tatsuya Shiba!</b>

16:51.860 --> 16:53.490
<b><i>Ghost Walker!</i></b>

17:03.500 --> 17:07.420
<b>Why isn't my Ghost Walker spell
working on you?</b>

17:07.710 --> 17:10.630
<b>Ghost Walker is amazing.</b>

17:10.630 --> 17:13.720
<b>Your spell was actually effective.</b>

17:13.720 --> 17:17.850
<b>I couldn't tell
you were trying to slip past me.</b>

17:18.260 --> 17:20.600
<b>I don't understand.</b>

17:20.600 --> 17:23.810
<b>Are you saying that the attack
you just launched was a fluke?</b>

17:24.390 --> 17:26.810
<b>I didn't know where you were.</b>

17:27.190 --> 17:31.900
<b>But I could detect the movement
of Saburo Nakura's blood inside you.</b>

17:32.230 --> 17:34.570
<b>Saburo Nakura's blood...</b>

17:34.570 --> 17:35.570
<b>from that day?</b>

17:38.950 --> 17:42.080
<b>Did he pierce you with needles
made of blood, maybe?</b>

17:42.080 --> 17:46.830
<b>Normally, foreign substances are dissipated
from inside the body after two weeks.</b>

17:46.830 --> 17:49.960
<b>I guess he must've poured
some extra powerful emotion into it.</b>

17:50.380 --> 17:52.550
<b>Emotion?</b>

17:52.550 --> 17:56.800
<b>I thought Modern Magic theory
had dispensed with that as a factor.</b>

17:57.220 --> 18:00.470
<b>No matter what your argument may be,
what exists, exists.</b>

18:00.470 --> 18:02.220
<b>What doesn't, doesn't.</b>

18:02.220 --> 18:04.350
<b>It exists without existing?</b>

18:04.350 --> 18:07.940
<b>But some things exist while not existing, and some
things don't exist while also existing, you know.</b>

18:08.270 --> 18:10.610
<b>Save your lectures
for when you're behind bars.</b>

18:10.940 --> 18:13.570
<b>Although I might not be able
to grant you that much time.</b>

18:13.900 --> 18:17.280
<b>Either way, you're going to kill me, then?</b>

18:17.280 --> 18:19.570
<b>That's not up to me.</b>

18:20.740 --> 18:23.120
<b>So, there's no point
in begging for my life?</b>

18:23.120 --> 18:28.120
<b>As long as Saburo Nakura's blood remains
inside you, you can never escape me.</b>

18:28.540 --> 18:30.580
<b>So, this is the end?</b>

18:36.880 --> 18:38.470
<b>Yes, this is the end.</b>

18:39.640 --> 18:41.050
<b>True.</b>

18:41.050 --> 18:42.760
<b>It does seem like it.</b>

18:43.930 --> 18:48.230
<b>However, you cannot capture me!</b>

18:48.850 --> 18:50.480
<b>I will never be wiped out!</b>

18:50.810 --> 18:54.230
<b>Even if I should die, I will go on existing!</b>

18:54.230 --> 18:55.730
<b>Ichijo, step back!</b>

19:09.750 --> 19:13.250
<b>Did Gongjin Zhou really die?</b>

19:13.590 --> 19:15.250
<b>He hasn't gotten away.</b>

19:15.250 --> 19:19.760
<b>There's no question that Gongjin Zhou
burned to death in those flames.</b>

19:24.220 --> 19:26.430
<b><i>Brother, are you all right?</i></b>

19:26.430 --> 19:28.430
<b>Yes. I'm fine.</b>

19:28.810 --> 19:30.190
<b>Thank goodness!</b>

19:30.190 --> 19:31.810
<b>What about Gongjin Zhou?</b>

19:32.150 --> 19:33.610
<b>He's dead.</b>

19:33.610 --> 19:35.440
<b>He's no longer with us.</b>

19:36.030 --> 19:38.150
<b><i>Just what I'd expect of you, Brother.</i></b>

19:38.150 --> 19:41.030
<b><i>I'll be awaiting your return, then.</i></b>

19:41.030 --> 19:41.950
<b>Right.</b>

19:49.120 --> 19:51.870
<b>Welcome home, Brother!</b>

19:51.870 --> 19:53.920
<b>I'm home, Miyuki.</b>

19:57.420 --> 20:00.670
<b>OCTOBER 28, A.D. 2096
THE DAY OF THE THESIS COMPETITION</b>

19:57.670 --> 19:59.090
<b>I see.</b>

19:59.090 --> 20:02.380
<b>So, the person who killed
Mr. Nakura committed suicide?</b>

20:02.380 --> 20:05.600
<b>He took his own life after
we'd driven him into a corner...</b>

20:05.600 --> 20:08.560
<b>so I'm not sure if we can call it a suicide.</b>

20:08.890 --> 20:10.480
<b>It's better that way.</b>

20:10.480 --> 20:14.770
<b>Since it means you avenged
Mr. Nakura for me.</b>

20:15.310 --> 20:17.530
<b>Thanks, Tatsuya!</b>

20:19.650 --> 20:22.950
<b>As you can see, it is possible to conclude...</b>

20:22.950 --> 20:24.700
<b>that the essence
of Engraving-Type spells...</b>

20:24.700 --> 20:27.540
<b>isn't dependent upon
the Engraved object itself.</b>

20:31.040 --> 20:35.290
<b>Next up will be
Second High School's presentation.</b>

20:35.290 --> 20:39.000
<b>The theme is "The Principle
of Sensory Interference Magic...</b>

20:35.290 --> 20:44.180
<b>THE THESIS AND THE PRINCIPLE
OF SENSORY INTERFERENCE MAGIC
AND THE THEORY BEHIND
ITS ACTIVATION SEQUENCE</b>

20:39.000 --> 20:42.510
<b>and the Theory Behind its Activation Sequence."</b>

20:42.510 --> 20:44.180
<b>It will be presented by Minoru Kudou.</b>

20:44.430 --> 20:45.550
<b>What?</b>

20:45.550 --> 20:46.930
<b>Minoru?</b>

20:50.770 --> 20:54.440
<b>...assuming this,
all Sensory Interference Magic...</b>

20:54.810 --> 20:58.520
<b>created when thoughts are formed
can theoretically be developed...</b>

20:58.520 --> 21:00.940
<b>into magic as a pure technology...</b>

21:00.940 --> 21:06.620
<b>by observing and analyzing
the Psion information bodies.</b>

21:21.840 --> 21:24.220
<b>As you just heard...</b>

21:24.220 --> 21:29.220
<b>Tatsuya Shiba is beneficial to the Yotsubas,</b>

21:29.220 --> 21:33.730
<b>and his loyalty toward his job
also seems impeccable.</b>

21:34.270 --> 21:38.480
<b>The purpose of this mission
was to test Tatsuya.</b>

21:38.480 --> 21:42.110
<b>The result was as Mr. Hayama
reported just now.</b>

21:42.110 --> 21:44.740
<b>You all agree with him, don't you?</b>

21:44.860 --> 21:49.240
<b>THE HEAD OF THE SHIBATA FAMILY
THE HEAD OF THE MASHIBA FAMILY
THE HEAD OF THE SHIIBA FAMILY</b>

21:45.110 --> 21:47.660
<b><i>We're going to have to acknowledge it.</i></b>

21:47.660 --> 21:50.280
<b><i>True, it's a talent
that we wouldn't want to lose.</i></b>

21:50.280 --> 21:53.370
<b><i>He passed this time. This time, that is.</i></b>

21:53.500 --> 21:57.880
<b>THE HEAD OF
THE MUGURA FAMILY
THE HEAD OF
THE TSUKUBA FAMILY
THE HEAD OF
THE SHIZUKA FAMILY</b>

21:53.700 --> 21:57.880
<b><i>Don't you think we should let go
of our irrational prejudices?</i></b>

21:57.880 --> 21:59.340
<b><i>I agree.</i></b>

21:59.340 --> 22:02.630
<b><i>It's time we became more objective.</i></b>

22:02.630 --> 22:08.390
<b><i>But it's also an objective fact
that Tatsuya Shiba has only one-sided skills.</i></b>

22:08.800 --> 22:11.390
<b><i>What do you think, Mr. Kuroba?</i></b>

22:15.310 --> 22:18.480
<b>I failed this mission.</b>

22:18.810 --> 22:23.980
<b>I don't think I have the right
to voice my opinion on this matter.</b>

22:30.950 --> 22:36.870
<b>In that case, let us put our conclusion on hold
until the New Year's banquet.</b>

22:45.010 --> 22:47.130
<b>DECEMBER, A.D. 2096</b>

23:01.610 --> 23:04.230
<b>MAYA YOTSUBA</b>

23:07.740 --> 23:09.240
<b><i>Tatsuya...</i></b>

23:09.240 --> 23:10.610
<b>Aunt Maya...</b>

23:10.950 --> 23:14.870
<b><i>You will attend this year's banquet
on New Year's Day.</i></b>

23:30.260 --> 23:32.720
<b>INVITATION FOR
THE NEW YEAR'S BANQUET</b>

23:32.720 --> 23:35.390
<b>BEST REGARDS
MAYA YOTSUBA</b>

23:35.390 --> 23:39.440
<b>THE IRREGULAR AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL</b>
